        {
         "@type": "meaningComprehension",
         "comprehends": [
          "copies/kq525dc4373.jsonld#inscription-text"
         ],
         "note": "Pencil, written along the roll. The 3s are written with closed bowls and could be read as 8s, but 80 is impossible as a day and the year figure has the same form as the day's first figure. The month figure matches the 5s of the pencilled roll number 1755 in region 4. Region 3 shows the leader label 'WELTE-MIGNON No. 1755. Accompaniment for Sopran / Widmung (Devotion) / R. Schumann / Played by [signature] / 25. III. 09.' - a printed label date, distinct from this punch date."
        }
       ]
      }
     }
    },
